blurb = "Depicts roadside lanterns on a rainy night in Nikkō, Tochigi prefecture. The area is famous for its tall cedars which can be seen in this print. The saying \"Never say kekkō (magnificent) until you've seen Nikkō\" is a reference to the city's beauty."
